        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 146687,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Şimdiye kadar while döngüsü oluşturmayı öğrendik; şimdi de sonsuz döngüye girmelerini nasıl durduracağımıza odaklanalım.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;game loop tick&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 146688,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir döngüyü durdurmak için önce döngünün dışında bir değişken oluşturarak başlarız.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"22\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;game loop tick&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>let</code>, ardından <code>gameRunning</code> ve sonra <code>=</code>, <code>true</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 146689,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Döngünün kod bloğunu çalıştırıp çalıştırmayacağına karar vermek için koşuldaki değişkeni kullanırız. Örneğin, <code>(gameRunning === true)</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"46\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (gameRunning === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;game loop tick&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>gameRunning</code>, ardından <code>===</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 146690,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kod bloğunun içinde, koşulun <code>false</code> döndürmesi için <code>gameRunning</code> değerini <code>false</code> olarak ayarlayarak döngüyü durdururuz.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"107\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (gameRunning === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;game loop tick&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>false</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 146691,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Döngü, başlangıçta <code>gameRunning</code> değeri <code>true</code> olduğu için tüm kod bloğunu çalıştırır, ancak <code>gameRunning</code> değerini <code>false</code> olarak ayarlarsak tekrar çalışmaz.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"120\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (gameRunning === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;gameRunning: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + gameRunning);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;gameRunning: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + gameRunning);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>false</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 146692,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu döngünün çalıştığını ve kod bloğunu tekrarlamayı hiç bırakmadığını nereden biliyoruz?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levelLoaded = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Spawning enemies&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Koşulda değişken yok</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Koşul <code>false</code> olduğu için bu döngü çalışmayacak</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koşulda değişken yok.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 146693,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>while</code> döngüsünün kod bloğunu atladığını nasıl anlarız?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPaused = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isPaused === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Paused...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>isPaused</code>'ın değeri <code>false</code>, ancak koşul onun <code>true</code> olup olmadığını kontrol ediyor</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>isPaused</code> değerinin <code>false</code> olması ve koşulun bunun <code>false</code> olup olmadığını kontrol etmesi</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>isPaused</code>'ın değeri <code>false</code>, ancak koşul onun <code>true</code> olup olmadığını kontrol ediyor.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 146694,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu döngünün durduğunu nasıl biliyoruz?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (gameRunning === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Update player and enemies&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>gameRunning</code> değişkeni kod bloğunun içinde <code>false</code> olarak güncellenir</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Döngünün durup durmadığını bilmiyoruz</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>gameRunning</code> değişkeni kod bloğunun içinde <code>false</code> olarak güncellenir.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 146695,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kod konsolda ne görüntüler?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (gameRunning === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level start!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Seviye başladı!</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Bu kod konsolda hiçbir şey görüntülemiyor</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Seviye başladı!</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 146696,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Değişkeni while döngüsünün koşulunda kullanabilmek için kod bloğunun dışında oluştur.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (gameRunning === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Starting level...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>let</code>, ardından <code>gameRunning</code> ve sonra <code>=</code>, <code>true</code>, <code>;</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 146697,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Koşulun içinde <code>isPaused</code> değişkenini kullanarak döngüyü atla.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"37\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPaused = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isPaused === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Paused...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" isPaused = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>isPaused</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 146698,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kod bloğunun içinde, kod bloğunu çalıştırdıktan sonra <code>gameRunning</code>'i <code>false</code> olarak güncelleyerek döngüyü durdur.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"105\" /><option startIndex=\"106\" endIndex=\"111\" /><option startIndex=\"111\" endIndex=\"112\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (gameRunning === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy wave spawned&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>gameRunning</code>, ardından <code>=</code> ve sonra <code>false</code>, <code>;</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
